    "sub_name": "退休金規劃",
    "sub_ename": "PENSION PLANNING",
    "describe_ch": " 本課程預期教導學生退休金與私人年金保險之功用與重要性。期許學生能了解退休金與年金保險之專業知識，並嘗試規劃個人退休需求。",
    "describe_eh": " This course is designed to help undergraduate students to understand the functions and importance of pension plans and annuity market. My primary objective of this course is to provide students with professional knowledge and skills to function as pension fund managers for personal pension planning.",
